  648:+        "This is the first 'real' artifact in the spring-boot-*-test family to be onboarded here — its sibling POM-only starters (e.g. spring-boot-starter-micrometer-metrics-test) are already marked not-for-native-image with this artifact as the replacement, but there's no prior PR in this repo for a sibling like spring-boot-webmvc-test/spring-boot-restclient-test to cross-check the exact test shape against."
