ccess`, 100% line coverage, and `0/0` dynamic-access calls, so the metrics currently conflate missing instrumentation output with a genuine no-dynamic-access result.\n\nInspect:\n- `logs/org.springframework.boot:spring-boot-micrometer-metrics-test:4.1.1/gradle-test/gradle-test-2026-10-07T05-24-36-243697Z.log`\n- `logs/org.springframework.boot:spring-boot-micrometer-metrics-test:4.1.1/gradle-test/gradle-test-2026-10-07T14-43-16-094027Z.log`\n- `logs/org.springframework.boot:spring-boot-micrometer-metrics-test:4.1.1/gradle-test/gradle-test-2026-10-07T14-48-00-667731Z.log`\n- `logs/org.springframework.boot:spring-boot-micrometer-metrics-test:4.1.1/dynamic-access-report/generateDynamicAccessCoverageReport-2026-10-07T13-16-29-968029Z.log`\n- `logs/org.springframework.boot:spring-boot-micrometer-metrics-test:4.1.1/finalization/generateLibraryStats-2026-10-07T15-09-46-817865Z.log`\n\nManual next steps:\n1. Review the final 10-test suite to confirm replacing the Spring Test AOT-dependent tests still exercises the intended public behavior.\n2. Clean and rerun the coordinate’s test and dynamic-access-report tasks, then determine why `TrackDynamicAccess` produces no output directory.\n3. Once missing output versus a legitimate zero-call result is resolved, regenerate the metrics and resume publication from the preserved branch.", "textSignature": "{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0c2692b267c0a834016ac6633d533487d182a38c39cffa00a5\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}], "api": "openai-codex-responses", "provider": "openai-codex", "model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "usage": {"input": 37211, "output": 1628, "cacheRead": 163328, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 1034, "totalTokens": 202167, "cost": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0}}, "stopReason": "stop", "timestamp": 1791386408078, "responseId": "resp_0c2692b267c0a834016ac66328ce5487d1a1a4de1ad4bc0ddc", "rawStopReason": "completed"}}
